OpenPinsheet uses four licences, one for each kind of work.

  api/ (the server), and           AGPL-3.0-or-later
  tests/test_api_*.py
  api/openapi.json, schema/,        Apache-2.0
  tools/, the other tests/,
  .github/
  FORMAT.md, API.md and the         CC-BY-4.0
  other texts
  examples/                         ODbL-1.0

The full texts are in LICENSES/. REUSE.toml states the licence of each file
in machine-readable form (https://reuse.software).

Copyright (C) 2026 the OpenPinsheet contributors.

The published pin positions stand under the Open Database License 1.0. They
are not in this repository.
